<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1PET - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petro</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA MARHANZI GA PETRO</para>
  <para style="h">MARUBA MARHANZI GA PETRO</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA MARHANZI GA PETRO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Petro, ntumwa ya Yezu Kristu, oku bîshogwa bashandabîne omu Ponto, omu Galasiya, omu Kapadociya, omu Aziya n’omu Bitiniya. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Mwe Nyamuzinda Îshe acîshogaga omu bumanye bwâge, anammucêsa na Mûka Mutagatîfu, mpu lyo muyumva Yezu Kristu munashahizibwe n’omukò gwâge: kuli mwe enshôkano n’omurhûla munji!<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulangâlire n’obucire bw’abemêzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Ayâgirwe Nyamuzinda, îshe wa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu! Omu lukogo lwâge lunji, àrhubusire buhyâhya, arhuhà obulangâlire bulêrha obuzîne, erhi afûla Yezu Kristu omu bafîre, <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>mpu lyo rhuyish’iyîma omu bwâmi burhaheka, burhalimwo izâbyo, burhankanayûrha, bulya bwâmi mubîkîrwe omu mpingu, <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>mwe mulangwa n’obuhashe bwa Nyamuzinda erhi buyêmêre bwinyu burhuma, mpu lyo muyish’ibona bulya bucire bwâfulûlwa omu nsiku nzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ensiku nzinda: aha kuli kuderha okuyûrha kw’igulu.</char></note>.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzigire n’obuyêmêre kuli Yezu Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Co cirhumire mudwîrhe mwacîshinga, ciru mukabà muciri omu marhangulo ga ngasi lubero kasanzi kasungunu; <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>na ntyo buyêmêre bwinyu - bugwêrhe ecitwîro kulusha amasholo barhangula obwinjà bwâgo omu muliro, n’obwo kusherêra gasherêra - buyish’ibà bukuze n’irenge linyu, bunarhume mwakengwa olusiku Yezu Kristu acîyêrekana. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Mumuzigira murhanasâg’imulolakwo; mumuyêmêra n’obwo murhasâg’imubona, n’omwîshingo gwinyu gurhankaderhwa gunayunjwîre irenge, <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>bulya mumanyire oku buyêmêre bwinyu bwammuhisa oku bucire bwinyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulangâlire bw’abalêbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Obwo bucire bwo abalêbi balêbaga enshôkano mwâli mubîkîrwe bakâg’ilongereza n’okuhumba; <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>bacîhangâna okumanya mango gahi na bimanyîso­ bici Omûka gwa Kristu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye Mûka Mutagatîfu wakâg’ibwiriza abalêbi ebi bamanyîsa.</char></note> gwabalimwo gwakâg’ibalangûla, erhi gukâbabwîriza, embere bibè, amalumwa ga Kristu n’irenge lyânagakulikire. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Bafulûlirwa oku obugo bali bahîrwe burhali bwâbo bône, ci bwinyu: obwo bugo bw’obûla bàmmumanyisize balya bàmmuyigîrizagya Emyanzi y’Akalembe mwa ganôla mango n’oburhabâle bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu warhumagwa kurhenga empingu. Eryo ihwe ciru na bamalahika basîma bwenêne okulisinza.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucisêza okuhinduka bimâna n’okubà masù</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Kuziga musêze omukaba omu bibunu by’enkengêro zinyu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwo kuderha: muyôrhe mucîrheganyize.</char></note>, mubè masù, munalangâlire bwenêne enshôkano mwayish’ishobôla olusiku Yezu Kristu acîyêrekana. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Nka kula abâna bumvi bajira, murhacishubîriraga iralà linyu lya mîra, galya mango mwaciri bahwinja; <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>ci ninyu mubè batagatîfu omu lugendo lwinyu lwoshi nka kulya owammuhamagalaga abà Mutagatîfu, <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1, 16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19, 2</ref>.</char></note>: Mwâbà batagatîfu, bulyâla nie ono mbà Mutagatîfu. <verse eid="1PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Na kulya kubà oyu muderha mpu ye Sho arhajira kabôlo, ci anatwîre ngasi muntu nk’oku ebijiro byâge binashingânîne, muyôrhe murhînya amango muciri eno ihanga. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Mumanye oku murhakûlagwa omu bwôrhere bw’obujà basho bàmmuyahukizagya n’ebirugu byankasherêra, nk’amasholo erhi ensaranga, <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>ci n’omukò gw’ecitwîro cidârhi gwa Kristu, ye Mwâna-buzi mwêru-kwêru orhalikwo izâbyo. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Nêci, oyo mwâna-buzi ali mwîshogwa erhi ciru igulu lirhasâg’igera amango lyâlemwe, ci mw’ezi nsiku nzinda mwo acîyêrekîne erhi mwe murhuma. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Ye igwârhiro ly’obuyêmêre bwinyu muli Nnâmahanga wamufûlaga omu bafîre anamujîsa irenge, mpu lyo Nyamuzinda abà ye buyêmêre na bulangâlire bwinyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzigirana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Erhi muyêmêra okushimba okuli, mwacêsize emirhima yinyu, mpu lyo muzigirana nk’abalondana buzira bulyâlya. Nêci muzigirane n’omurhima gucîre na burharhama, <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>bulya mwabusirwe buhyâhya, arhali n’emburho esherêra, ci n’emburho erhankahash’isherêra, lwo Luderho lwa Nyamuzinda luzîne lw’ensiku n’amango. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Bulya, nêci, ngasi ciderhwa mubiri kwo ciri nka hyasi, n’irenge lyâgwo lyoshi kwo liri nka bwâso bwa byâsi; ebyâsi bikayuma, obwâso bwanahugumuka; ci Oluderho lwa Nyakasane lwohe luyôrha luhabà ensiku n’amango<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1, 24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Iz 40, 6-8</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="1PE 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>Olwo Luderho lwa Nyakasane lw’ensiku n’amango lwo mwayigîrizîbwe omu Myanzi y’Akalembe.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwîrhôhye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Kuziga mulekage ngasi bubî na ngasi bunywesi, obulyâlya n’obuyâgalwa na ngasi kalimi kabî. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>Nka rhubonjo rhwaciburhwa, mushwîre amarhà minjà g’obunya-mûka, lyo mukula munahike omu bucire, <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>akabà mwalabwîre<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2, 3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 34:9."><ref loc="PSA 34:33--1">Lul 34(33), 9</ref></char></note> oku Nyakasane abà mwinjà!<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obudâhwa buhyâhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Mumujêho! Kali ye lirya ibuye ly’obuzîne abantu balahiraga, ci lirhôle na lya citwîro cidârhi omu masù ga Nyamuzinda! <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Ninyu mubè nka mabuye gazîne, mujè omu bûbake bw’enyumpa y’obunya-mûka, muhinduke badâhwa batagatîfu b’okurherekêra enterekêro z’obunya-mûka zasîmîsa Nyamuzinda oku bulagizi bwa Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2, 6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Iz 28, 16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Rom 9, 33</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:11">10, 11</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Ka murhabwîni oku mpizire omu Siyoni ibuye-kaboko ka nyumpa</char>, <char style="qt">liri lirhôle na lya citwîro cidârhi</char>; <char style="qt">na ngasi yêshi wacîlikubagîre arhakabona nshonyi</char>. <verse eid="1PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Nêci, kuli mwe obukuze, mwe bemêzi; ci abalahîre okuyêmêra, ibuye abûbasi bagayaguzagya, lyâyish’ibà kaboko ka nyumpa, <verse eid="1PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>lihinduke ibuye ly’okusârhaza n’ery’okuhirimya<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2, 8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Iz 8, 14</ref>.</char></note>. Balisârhalakwo, kulya kubà barhayêmêra Oluderho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olwo Luderho, yo Myanzi y’Akalembe Abayahudi balahiraga okuyankirira.</char></note>, n’obwo olwo Luderho lwo bàlemeragwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Ci mwêhe muli ishanja lîshogwa, muli badâhwa b’ebwâmi, muli mulala Mutagatîfu, muli lubaga lurhôle Nyamuzinda acungulaga mpu mukâyimba ebirhangâzo by’olya wammukûlaga omu mwizimya, ammuhama­gala mpu mujè omu bulangashane bwâge bw’okusômeza; <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>mwe murhali lubaga lwâge mîra, buno mukola lubaga lwa Nyamuzinda; mwe murhagwêrhe cababalira, buno mukola mubêrîrwe obwonjo.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku abemêzi bakwânîne okuyôrha ekarhî k’abapagani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Bîra bâni, mmuhûnyire, mwe muli nka bigolo na nka babalama en’igulu, nti mucîlange oku iralà ly’omubiri likâlwîsa omûka. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Olugendo lwinyu lubè nkana ekarhî k’abapagani. Ciru bankammunywerhera mpu muli banyankola-maligo, babone ebijiro binyu binjà banakuze Nnâmahanga olusiku ayish’ibarhandûla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olwo lusiku, lwo lusiku lw’olubanja luzinda. Abapagani bayish’ishimba olwiganyo lw’abakristu, bakayankirira obuyêmêre, bayish’ijà omu irenge ly’akalamo k’ensiku n’amango. </char></note>.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukenga abakulu b’ecihugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Mukaz’iyumva ngasi murhegesi w’en’igulu erhi Nyakasane orhuma: akabà mwâmi, mumukengêre obukulu bwâge; <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>akabà barhambo, bulya barhumirwe naye, mpu bahane ababî banakunge abajira aminjà.<verse eid="1PE 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Ntyo kwo Nnâmahanga alonza: mpu omu kukola aminjà, mudumye abahwinja, barhishi bici. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Olugendo lwinyu lubè lwa bantagengwa, ci arhali bantagengwa balonza obulyo bw’okufulika obubî bwâbo, ci nka barhumisi ba Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Mukâkenga ngasi muntu; muzigire bene winyu; murhînye Nnâmahanga; mukenge mwâmi.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abashizi bayumve bannawâbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Mwe bashizi, mukâyumva bannâhamwinyu munabarhînye, arhali abinja n’abantu nkana bônene, ci n’abadârhi. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Bulya guli mugisho, okulembera amalibuko omuntu arhakwânîni erhi Nyamuzinda orhuma. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Ndi wankakungirwa okubà alembîre empîmbo obubî bwâge bwàli bukwânîne? Ci erhi mwankalembera amalumwa n’obwo mwajizire kwinjà, gwo mugisho ogwo embere za Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1PE 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>N’eco co mwahamagaliragwa, bulya Kristu alibuzîbwe erhi mwe murhuma, ammusigîre olwiganyo mpu mushimbe enshando zâge, <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>Yêhe àrhajiraga câha, n’obulyâlya burhabonekaga omu kanwa kâge. <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Erhi babà badwîrhe bamujâcira, arhagalulaga bijâci; erhi bakamulibuza, acîhumbira; ci acîhira omu maboko gw’Omucîranuzi otwa emmanja n’oburhondekezi. <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Ye wacîbarhuzagya ebyâha bîrhu omu mubiri gwâge oku murhi gw’omusalaba, mpu lyo rhufa oku byâha, rhunalamire obushinganyanya. Nêci, bibande byâge byàrhufumagya. <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Bulya mwâli muyôsire nka bibuzi birhêresire, ci buno mwashubîrîre lungere n’omulanzi w’emyûka yinyu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku abemêzi bakwânîne okuyôrha omu buhya bwâbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Ntyôla, ninyu mwe bakazi, mukâyumva babalo, lyo ciru hankajira abarhalonza okuyêmêra Oluderho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oluderho: Emyanzi y’Akalembe.</char></note>, balêrhwa n’olwiganyo lwa bakâbo buzira binwa, <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>basinza obucêse n’obukenge bw’olugendo lwinyu. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Okulimba kwinyu kurhabâga kw’embuga: okuhunga emviri, okuyambala orhugondo rhw’amasholo, n’okulimbira emyambalo minjinjà; <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>ci kubè omu ndubi y’omurhima gwinyu, omu malimbo garhankahash’isherêra g’entimanya ziyunjwîre butûdu n’omurhûla; n’okwo kwo kujira akamalo omu masù ga Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Ntyôla kwo mîra bakazâg’ilimba abakazi batagatîfu: bakâg’iyumva bîba erhi banalangâlîre Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Ntyo kwo Sara<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Murh 18, 12</ref>.</char></note> akâg’iyumva Abrahamu, akamuderha nnâhamwâbo. Ninyu muli bâli bâge akabà mujira aminjà buzira kuyôboha cici.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Ninyu mwe balume, kwo na kuguma, omu kubêra na bakînywe mumanye oku omukazi cibà ciremwa cizamba kummulusha; mubakenge, bulya bayish’iyîma akinyu omu nshôkano y’obuzîne. Ntyo ntâco cankahanza ensengero zinyu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzigire bw’ecinyabuguma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Buzinda mweshi mweshi mulungane, mukaz’ifà abinyu olukogo, muzigirane nka bâna ba nda nguma, mubè ba bwonjo na bîrhôhye. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Murhakâg’igalula obubî oku bubî. Erhi ebijâci oku bijâci; ci mukâhâna obwangà erhikwo, bulya kwo mwahamagaliragwa okwo, lyo muyish’iyîma omu mugisho. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Bulya ngasi olonzize okusîma obuzîne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Owalonza bumubêre bwinjà bunamununire, <char style="xt" link-href="PSA 34:12-15"><ref loc="PSA 34:33-15">Lul 34(33), 12-15</ref></char>.</char></note> n’okubona ensiku z’obuholo, <char style="qt">alange olulimi lwâge okuderha kubî</char>, <char style="qt">n’akanwa kâge karharhengamwo nderho za bulyâlya</char>; <verse eid="1PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/><char style="qt">aleke obubî</char>, <char style="qt">ajire aminjà</char>, <char style="qt">alonze omurhûla</char>, <char style="qt">anagukulikire</char>. <verse eid="1PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Bulya abantu binjà Nyakasane abalola bwinjà<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3, 12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 34:13-17."><ref loc="PSA 34:33-17">Lul 34(33), 13-17</ref></char></note>, ayumvîrhiza ensengero zâbo; ci banya­nkola-maligo kubakengula abakengula.<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku abakristu bakwânîne okuyôrha omu malibuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Ndi wankammujirira kubî mukabà mucîhanganyire okujira aminjà? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Ci erhi mwankalibuzibwa erhi bushinganyanya burhuma, muli bany’iragi! Murhabayôbohaga ciru n’ehitya, murhanadirhimanaga, <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>ci muharâmye Nyakasane Kristu omu mirhima yinyu. Muyôrhe mucîrheganyize ensiku zoshi okushuza ngasi yêshi wammudôsa igwârhiro ly’obulangâlire bwinyu, <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>ci kwônene n’o­butûdu n’obwîrhôhye, bulya mugwêrhe omurhima mwinjà, lyo abashobeka olugendo lwinyu lwinjà muli Kristu, enshonyi zibagwârha omu ebi bammubêherakwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bammubêherakwo: bammuderherakwo busha.</char></note>. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Bulya kuli kukulu okulibuzibwa nka bammuhôla aminjà, akabà kwo Nyamuzinda alonzize, ahâli h’okuhôlwa amabî.<verse eid="1PE 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olwiganyo lwa Kristu wafûkaga anayandagalira omu irimbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Ntyo kwo Kristu naye afîre liguma kwa lwoshi oku byâha by’abantu; ye mwêru-kwêru afîra abanya-byâha, mpu arhuhise kuli Nnâmahanga; bulya anizirwe omu mubiri, ci agalulirwa obuzîne bw’Omûka. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Na ntyo agend’iyigîriza emyûka yali omu mpamikwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu mpamikwa: omu kuzimu, omu irimbo.</char></note>, <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>ezo ntumva za mîra, galya mango obwonjo bwa Nyamuzinda bwakâg’ilinda, mwa zirya nsiku Nûhu abinjaga enkugè. Mw’eyo nkugè banyi bône, bo bantu munâni, bacirîre omu mîshi. <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>A­gwo mîshi lwàli lwîganyo lw’obubatizo bummuciza bunôla ninyu, arhali omu kurhenza izinga ly’omubiri, ci omu kushenga Nnâmahanga n’omurhima gucîre, obufûke bwa Yezu Kristu burhumire; <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>ye bwârhîre ebwa kulyo kwa Nyamuzinda erhi abà amarheremera empingu, n’erhi abà amâhira bamalahika n’amâmi n’amahashe idako ly’oburhegesi bwâge.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Muleke ebyâha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Nêci, bulya Kristu, ababazîbwe omu mubiri gwâge, ninyu ezi nkengêro zibè yo mirasano yinyu: owababîre omu mubiri ahakanyire ecâha, <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>mpu ly’ensiku zicimusigalîre en’igulu arhazigeza omu iralà ly’abantu, ci omu kujira obulonza bwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Ka ziri nyi ensiku mwalamire nka bapagani, omu kuhusha, omu kushimba iralà ly’omubiri, omu ndalwè n’okulya obudâmbye, omu kunywa buzira lugero n’okugashâniza ebiremwa? <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Lêro bakola barhangâla kulya kubà murhacigenda mwe nabo mw’eyo njira mbî y’eby’enshonyi, bajekwo bammujâcira. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Ci ebyo byoshi bânabidôsibwe n’olya ocîrheganyize okuyish’itwîra abazîne n’abafîre olubanja. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Kali ciru kwo kwarhumaga okwo abafîre nabo bayigîrizibwa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 6 </char><char style="xta" closed="false">Rhulole </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:19-20">3, 19-20</ref>.</char></note> Emyanzi y’Akalembe, mpu lyo bo bayâzire omu lubanja lw’omubiri omu masù g’abantu, babona obuzîne bw’omûka embere za Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubà masù n’okuzigirana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Obuzinda bw’ebintu byoshi buli hôfi. Kuziga mubè bîrhonzi, munalange olugero<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olugero omu biryo, omu binyôbwa n’omu ngasi bisîmîsa omubiri.</char></note> lyo muhash’ishenga. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Ci bwenêne muzigirane mwêne na nnene, bulya obuzigire buzâza omwandu gw’ebyâha. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Mukâhandisanya buzira kucîduduma. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Ngasi muguma arhabâle abâbo nk’oku agabîrwe enshôkano, kulya kunakwânîne abarhindisi binjà b’engalo ya Nyamuzinda ya ngasi lubero. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Owahîrwe omukolo gw’oburhumisi, agukole n’emisî ya Nnâmahanga, lyo muli byoshi Nyamuzinda akuzibwa erhi Yezu Kristu orhuma. Kuli ye irenge n’obuhashe emyâka n’emyâka. Amen!<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhayôboha amalibuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Bîra bâni, irhondo mumanye murhacisômeragwa, nka kulya omuntu afuduka akantu arhishi, n’engulumira y’omuliro eri omu kâgarhî mpu emmurhangule. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Ci erhi mwankashangîra amababale ga Kristu, mucîshinge, lyo muyish’iyumva amasîma n’omwîshingo olusiku acîyêrekana omu irenge lyâge. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Erhi mwankajâcirwa erhi izîno lya Kristu lirhuma, iragi linyu, kulya kubà Omûka gw’irenge, gwo Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda, gummulimwo. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Muli mwe harhajiraga owalibuzibwa nka mwîsi wa bantu, erhi nka cisharnbo, nîsi erhi nka nyankola-maligo, erhi nka ndyâlya; <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>ci erhi omuntu ankalibuzibwa bulya ali mukristu, arhafâga nshonyi, akuze Nyamuzinda wamushobôzagya eryo izîno. <verse eid="1PE 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Bulya amango gahisire, n’olubanja lwârhangirira oku nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enyumpa ya Nyamuzinda yo Ekleziya. Olwo lubanja, go malibuko garhangula abemêzi n’okubarheganya oku lusiku lw’olubanja luzinda.</char></note>. N’akabà rhwe lwârhangirirekwo, balya barhayêmêra Emyanzi y’Akale­mbè kurhi obuzinda bwâbo bwâbe wâni! <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Akabà okucunguka kw’omushinganyanya kuli kudârhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Mig 11, 31</ref>.</char></note>, kurhi omubî n’omunya-byâha anâbè? <verse eid="1PE 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Ntyo, abadwîrhe balibuka oku bulonza bwa Nyamuzinda bahîre obuzîne bwâbo omu maboko ga Lulema orhatwa omu kanwa kâge, banacîhangâne okukâjira aminjà.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Petro ahanûla abagula b’Ekleziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Abagula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abagula erhi abashosi, bo badâhwa n’abajinji (abasaserdoti n’abacigofu) b’Ekleziya.</char></note> bali muli mwe, alagi ihano mbahire, nie mugula akabo, nie na câliho c’amababale ga Kristu, nie nanayish’ishangira irenge lyânabonekane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irenge Kristu ânayishemwo aha kuyûrha kw’igulu.</char></note>. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Muyâbule obusò bwa Nyamuzinda mwahizirwemwo, arhali nk’abasêzîbwe, ci n’omurhima gwinyu gwoshi, nk’oku Nyamuzinda alonzize, arhali omu kulonza obunguke bubî, ci n’omurhima nkana. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Murhazidoheraga abamwahîrwe mpu mubarhegeke, ci mubè lwîganyo lw’obusò. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>N’amango Lungere w’abangere acîyêrekana, mwahâbwa ishungwè ly’irenge lirhakasherêra.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahanûla emisole n’abandi bemêzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Ninyu mwe misole, mukâyumva abagula. Mweshi muhwinje omwambalo gw’obwîrhôhye omu kuyôrha n’abinyu; bulya abacîbonyi Nyamuzinda kucîka abacîka ci abîrhôhye bo ashobôza engalo yâge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5, 5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Mig 3, 34</ref>; </char><char style="xta" closed="false">Lolà </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:6">Yak 4, 6</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Kuziga mucîrhohye embere z’okuboko kugala-byoshi kwa Nyamuzinda, lyo ammukuza omu mango ga­kwânîne <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Amalagîrire ginyu goshi mugahire omu maboko gâge, bulya kushîbirira ayôrha ammushîbirira. <verse eid="1PE 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Mulange olugero munabè masù! Omushombanyi winyu, Shetani, nka ntale yaluluma, adwîrhe azunguluka-zunguluka, mpu alonze oyu amira. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Mumuhagalike n’obuzibu bw’obuyêmêre bwinyu, munamanye oku ago malibuko go ganadwîrhe galibuza bene winyu bali omu igulu. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Na hano mubà mwamâlibuzibwa kasanzi katyunguli, Nyamuzinda w’enshôkano zoshi wammuhamagalaga okushangîra irenge lyâge ly’ensiku n’amango muli Kristu Yezu, yêne âmmuyumanyanya âmmukomeze, âmmuzibuhya anammujire ntadundagana. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Kuli ye irenge n’obuhashe emyâka n’emyâka. Amen!<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amahano mazinda, omusingo n’obwangà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Mmuyandikîre ebi binwa bisungunu n’okuboko kwa Silvano, mwene wîrhu mbona nk’akwânîne okucîkubagirwa, nti mmuhanûle nampamîrize oku eyo yo nshôkano y’okuli ya Nyamuzinda: muyisêremwo buzibu. <verse eid="1PE 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Ekleziya eri e Babiloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E Babiloni: e Roma, ngasi washâbire Yeruzalemu, Abayahudi banamuhè erya Babiloni, bulya Babiloni ye wali murhanzi okushâba Yeruzalemu.</char></note>, ntôle akinyu, emmulamusize; na mugala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«mugala wâni Marko», ali olya muganda wayandikaga ecitabu ca kabiri c’Emyanzi y’Akalembe. Ali mugala wa Petro, bulya Petro ye wamubatizagya, owabatizagya omuntu erhi amamuburha bunya-mûka.</char></note> wâni Marko naye a­mmulamusize. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Mulamusanye n’ehinûnugurho hy’obuzigire. Obuholo kuli mwe mweshi muli Kristu!<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
